<title>UK: CMG yr pre-tax rises 37 pct.</title>
<headline>CMG yr pre-tax rises 37 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		27.4		   vs 21.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.0		    vs 3.2</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    27.5		   vs 20.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   245.2		  vs 196.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the Anglo-Dutch computer services company is CMG Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
